{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Common.TwistUnconditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Common.TwistUnconditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.Common.BalancedQuantumTwist","lean:module:QOU.Common.HookSumComplete"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TwistUnconditional.partition_twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TwistUnconditional.partition_twist","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/TwistUnconditional.lean#L51-L75","doc":"**The unconditional balanced quantum-dimension twist for a partition.** For any\nweakly-decreasing `λ` (a `List ℕ`) with column bound `M`, and `q ≠ 0` over a field,\nthe balanced-numerator twist holds with the hook exponent given by the **proved**\nvalue `colSum λ M + bStat λ + l.sum = b(λ') + b(λ) + n` — the previously-hypothesised\nhook-sum is now discharged by `hookSum_eq`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TwistUnconditional.card_cellsOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TwistUnconditional.card_cellsOf","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/TwistUnconditional.lean#L44-L49","doc":"The cell count of `λ` is `|λ| = l.sum`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TwistUnconditional.sum_hookLenP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TwistUnconditional.sum_hookLenP","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/TwistUnconditional.lean#L39-L42","doc":"The sum of hook lengths over the cells equals `hookSum` (Fubini over the sigma). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TwistUnconditional.hookLenP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TwistUnconditional.hookLenP","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/TwistUnconditional.lean#L35-L37","doc":"Hook length of a cell `(i, j)`: `arm + leg + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TwistUnconditional.cellsOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TwistUnconditional.cellsOf","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/TwistUnconditional.lean#L31-L33","doc":"The cells of `λ` as a sigma-Finset of `(row, col)` pairs. ","signatureChunk":0}]}